51cb-daef-5707-bf52-8de2fe15243f" :question/math-academy-id "q-105111" :question/problem "Let\n$r=\\begin{bmatrix}-3 \\\\ 6 \\\\ z \\\\ 4 \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix}$ and $s=\\begin{bmatrix}2 \\\\ z+1 \\\\ -9 \\\\ z \\\\ 7\\end{bmatrix}.$\nIf $r\\cdot s=1$, find the value of $z.$" :question/worked-solution "Starting from the equation $r\\cdot s=1,$ we compute the dot product in terms of $z$ and then solve for $z$ in the resulting equation:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}r\\cdot s & =1 \\\\ (-3)\\cdot 2+6\\cdot (z+1)+z\\cdot (-9)+4\\cdot z+1\\cdot 7 & =1 \\\\ -6+6z+6-9z+4z+7 & =1 \\\\ z & =-6\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, we conclude that $z=-6.$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186120307 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186119802 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "ab0d2c2f-e7a4-51bb-a20a-f28c2f7ded8b" :knowledge-point/title "Adding Multiples of Vectors"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "016d9ebc-610a-5f44-9c37-f3eb046a7735" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}-15 \\\\ 7 \\\\ 12 \\\\ 16 \\\\ 3\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186315124} {:answer/id #uuid "45d15d3d-d877-5a38-81b3-02c89b5f2d20" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}-12 \\\\ 10 \\\\ -15 \\\\ 13 \\\\ 6\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186315522} {:answer/id #uuid "54641b8e-e12c-5e9a-a462-e8273b927710" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "Undefined" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186315603} {:answer/id #uuid "6763e061-8de4-580d-bdd9-43acf89dd415" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}-13 \\\\ 6 \\\\ 17 \\\\ 15 \\\\ 2\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186315696} {:answer/id #uuid "adcda730-4312-5c49-9840-2d73fa93cba8" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}-15 \\\\ 2 